[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659460129","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99321#issuecomment-2659460129","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99321","id":2659460129,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ehCQh","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T14:19:56Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T14:19:56Z","body":"I don't doubt that this is a performance improvement, as this is swapping to the function specialized for this input, but we should really make a habit of including metrics with performance PRs (and/or the metrics of the PR adding this function)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659460129/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659468851","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99321#issuecomment-2659468851","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99321","id":2659468851,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ehEYz","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T14:23:28Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T14:25:27Z","body":"These are difficult to measure in situ, as they are scattered over the codebase, we lack proper tools to perform such performance tests, and proper documentation for the process, so until that exists that's hard to request (the tools and documentation has been requested on multiple occasions but hasn't surfaced yet)\r\n\r\nIf such existed and was provided it would be trivial to do so and would do so","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659468851/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659506638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99321#issuecomment-2659506638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99321","id":2659506638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ehNnO","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T14:40:36Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T14:50:33Z","body":"> we lack proper tools to perform such performance tests\r\n\r\nYou could always show the general performance difference between `get_slice` and `get_slicec` with a short benchmark. Personally, I think that's sufficient to show what kind of difference to expect :)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659506638/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659531171","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99321#issuecomment-2659531171","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99321","id":2659531171,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ehTmj","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T14:51:42Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T15:05:01Z","body":"For that the test is trivial and the test is trivial, and runs with a clear improvement:\r\n```\r\nString.get_slice():  2678840 usec for 5000000 iterations\r\nString.get_slicec(): 1557136 usec for 5000000 iterations\r\n```\r\n\r\nUsing MRP:\r\n[test-string-get_slicec.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18800890/test-string-get_slicec.zip)\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n<summary>PC specifications:</summary>\r\n\r\n* OS: Windows 11 (build 22631)\r\n* GPU: AMD Radeon RX 6750 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.24002.92)\r\n* CPU: AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\r\n* RAM: 32 GB\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nTested with an editor build, will test with a release build as well\r\n\r\nFor a release build (using `beta3` release templates) the result is:\r\n```\r\nString.get_slice():  398462 usec for 5000000 iterations\r\nString.get_slicec(): 345584 usec for 5000000 iterations\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659531171/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659542601","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99321#issuecomment-2659542601","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99321","id":2659542601,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ehWZJ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T14:56:37Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T14:56:54Z","body":"Well, this benchmark isn't entirely fair because you're calling from GDScript, i.e. `String::get_slice(String)` instead of `String::get_slice(char*)` which you're replacing in this PR. A lot of the difference from your test can be attributed to `String` allocation. I'm expecting more of a 1.2x difference to be realistic.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659542601/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659551666","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99321#issuecomment-2659551666","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99321","id":2659551666,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ehYmy","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T15:00:39Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T15:00:39Z","body":"This doesn't involve any string allocations, as it is a string literal in GDScript no string should be allocated on calling this (if it is that's a major bug in GDScript)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659551666/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659567597","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99321#issuecomment-2659567597","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99321","id":2659567597,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ehcft","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T15:05:21Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T15:06:22Z","body":"> This doesn't involve any string allocations, as it is a string literal in GDScript no string should be allocated on calling this (if it is that's a major bug in GDScript)\r\n\r\nInteresting, that changes things! \r\nStill, I'd caution to call code directly from C++ - or rather, in the exact same way as is replaced in the PR. Otherwise, you always risk unaccounted factors. I usually put code in `test_main.cpp` like so:\r\n```c++\r\n// Setup\r\nString s = \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.\";\r\n\r\nauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\nfor (int i = 0; i < 100000; i ++) {\r\n\tString s1 = s.get_slice(\",\", 0);\r\n}\r\nauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\nstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659567597/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659569999","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99321#issuecomment-2659569999","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99321","id":2659569999,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ehdFP","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T15:06:23Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T15:06:23Z","body":"I don't have such a setup prepared at the time being so can't test it until I set something up that would be reasonably isolated","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659569999/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659623772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99321#issuecomment-2659623772","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99321","id":2659623772,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ehqNc","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T15:27:28Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T15:29:09Z","body":"> I don't have such a setup prepared at the time being so can't test it until I set something up that would be reasonably isolated\r\n\r\nWe don't need to discuss your setup here - but I would be amiss not to mention that anywhere you can compile and run code is fine to benchmark on!\r\n\r\nAnyway, I'm happy to fill in - i ran this benchmark (debug build, `-O2`):\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Test Code</summary>\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\tString s = \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.\";\r\n\r\n\t// warmup\r\n\ts.get_slice(\",\", 0);\r\n\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < 20000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\t\tString s1 = s.get_slice(\",\", 0);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\t// warmup\r\n\ts.get_slicec(',', 0);\r\n\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < 20000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\t\tString s1 = s.get_slicec(',', 0);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nI got `1291ms` for `get_slice` and `986ms` for `get_slicec`. So the performance diff for in-situ code can be about 1.3x :)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659623772/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,